    "Sync your Instagram login from Safari, then retry this download.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请从 Safari 同步 Instagram 登录，然后重试下载。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "請從 Safari 同步 Instagram 登入，然後重試下載。"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Synchronisez votre connexion Instagram depuis Safari, puis réessayez ce téléchargement."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The synced login is used only for Instagram downloads on this device. Private browsing and other Safari profiles are not included automatically. Sync again after switching accounts or if the login expires.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同步的登录仅供本设备下载 Instagram 内容使用。无痕浏览和其他配置文件不会自动包含。切换账号或登录过期后，请重新同步。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同步的登入僅供本裝置下載 Instagram 內容使用。私密瀏覽和其他描述檔不會自動包含。切換帳號或登入到期後，請重新同步。"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La connexion synchronisée sert uniquement aux téléchargements Instagram sur cet appareil. La navigation privée et les autres profils Safari ne sont pas inclus automatiquement. Synchronisez à nouveau après un changement de compte ou l’expiration de la connexion."
          }
        }
      }
    },
